# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on the CPU
# (D198), scenario draws-copies of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# The velocities that `mdir run` draws, bit for bit, with and without
# constraints; refusals of draw_velocities; restraint copies, versions,
# and refusals.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir mdir-model-test %t draws-copies | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: drawn velocities (constraints False): 1168 particles, 0 differing bits against mdir run
# CHECK: drawn velocities (constraints True): 1168 particles, 0 differing bits against mdir run
# CHECK: draw_velocities refusals passed
# CHECK: restraint copies, versions and refusals passed
# CHECK: velocities and restraints draws-copies passed
